  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "Frame has variables, Body and the result destination in its caller. Configuration holds heap objects, nextId and a list of Frames, with top frame first. running reconstructs the active frame from a Shared State and pushes it ahead of the supplied callers. initial has exactly one empty-local no-result/no-destination frame; finished is exactly frames=[] including for arbitrary configurations. rootState flattens frame stores for Shared Live and roots filters initialized slots without deduplicating local names or references. The text correctly separates this reachability view from active-frame-only evaluation and removes all inactive stores.",
  "limitations": [
    "Author self-review, not an independent review.",
    "Abstract syntax and mathematical semantics; no surface parser is certified. GC is a noncomputable reachability filter. Functions safety permits divergence."
  ],
